    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fAdd in WishList!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483970/extras/855a850349f863dda34e6eb8eb690be7.avif?t=1725001088\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>&quot;On the eve of your honeymoon, your wife is murdered by a mysterious blonde colleage of yours. Things get worse when you're framed for the crime, brutally interrogated, and thrown in prison.<br><br>Escape from prison and break away from this timeline! Return to that tragic night and unlock the mystery to save your beloved!&quot;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>The devil is in the details! Observe your surroundings for any changes or anything that feels... off. Collect clues and items, unravel the mystery, and make your escape!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><strong>Three (+1) unique female chracters</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483970/extras/a3098913bc8f9227160c1835eebff2e5.avif?t=1725001088\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483970/extras/6c25b26e42ed9610d86a025bcc43f83b.avif?t=1725001088\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483970/extras/ea7e32a7579e33c989d0d89f929cf853.avif?t=1725001088\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483970/extras/4384a6d194b5e5fe96ce57cc74438f78.avif?t=1725001088\" /></span><br><br><br><strong>Six complex puzzles to wrap your brain around</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com